# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. Every value here is optional:
# the app runs with none of them set.
#
# `VITE_AMAP_KEY` turns on the base map in step 2 of the new-project flow.
# Without it that step shows coordinate inputs instead, and the flow works
# the same way — the map only helps you pick a point, it never decides one.
#
#   Key type: choose "Web服务" / Web JS API in the Amap console, NOT a
#   server-side key. This value is compiled into the built JavaScript and is
#   readable by anyone who loads the page, so a public deployment MUST use a
#   key restricted by referer whitelist. A key with no referer restriction is
#   spendable by anyone who finds it.
#
# Where to get one: https://console.amap.com/dev/key/app
VITE_AMAP_KEY=
